## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to connect observability across multiple protocols with a single trace, a core reliability skill in large-scale services.

## Key Concepts
- OpenTelemetry trace propagation across HTTP, GraphQL, and gRPC
- Consistent span naming across protocols
- Per-protocol adapters that preserve trace context

## Code Example
```javascript
// REST endpoint sketch
app.get('/notes/:id', (req, res) => {
  const span = tracer.startSpan('NotesService.GetNote', { parent: req.headers['traceparent'] });
  // fetch note...
  span.end();
  res.json(note);
});
```

